---
import { site } from "../config";
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/images/about-desk.jpg"
        alt="A quiet evening desk with a lamp, notes, glasses, and a laptop."
        width="1280"
        height="720"
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker__dot"></span>About</p>
      <h2 class="display">Built from a real pain, not a trend.</h2>
      <p>
        The developer behind EyesRhythm has spent more than two decades working as
        a software developer. Years of long hours in front of computer screens
        gradually took a toll on his eye health, leading to frequent dryness,
        redness, and, at times, significant discomfort.
      </p>
      <p>
        Advances in modern technology made it possible to create EyesRhythm: a
        simple, lightweight companion designed to support healthier blinking
        habits during extended screen use. Having personally used the
        application, he has found it useful and effective enough to share with
        others.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our goal is simple: to build technology that solves a real problem
        without creating another distraction. EyesRhythm works quietly in the
        background, helping users become more aware of their blink rhythm while
        staying focused on their work.
      </p>
      <p>
        We believe the best products are shaped by real experiences and honest
        feedback. If you choose to try EyesRhythm, we would greatly appreciate
        hearing about your experience at{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
        Your feedback will help us continue improving the product and ensure
        that it remains simple, useful, reliable, and unobtrusive.
      </p>
      <button class="btn btn--primary" type="button" data-open-purchase>
        {site.cta}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px) 0;
    background: var(--band);
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 28px;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-items: start;
  }

  .display {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .copy p {
    color: var(--text-soft);
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .copy a {
    color: var(--blue-deep);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
      gap: 56px;
    }
  }
</style>
